*** Keywords ***
General_SiSo_Auto_Cabinet_Temperature_Check
    [Documentation]
    ...  Verifies if temperature in cabinet is in correct range.
    ...  The temperature measurements are taken from real-time measurement tab.
    ...  The measurements are done every minute for specified duration.
    ...
    ...  ARGS:
    ...  :param str duration: (Optional): duration of the measurement in minutes. Defaults to 5 min.
    ...  :param str max_temperature: (Optional): maximum allowed temperature in Celsius. Defaults to 50.
    ...  :param str min_temperature: (Optional): minimum allowed temperature in Celsius. Defaults to 10.
    [Arguments]                                     ${duration}=5
    ...                                             ${max_temperature}=50
    ...                                             ${min_temperature}=10

    ${bts_type}                                     hwpta_testline.get_type_of_setup
    ${connection}                                   connections.get_default_admin_connection_alias
    ...                                             bts_type=${bts_type}

    ${temperature_measurements}=                    Measure Cabinet Temperature From Front Sensor
    ...                                             duration=${duration}
    ...                                             connection=${connection}

    Verify Cabinet Temperature From Front Sensor    max_temperature=${max_temperature}
    ...                                             min_temperature=${min_temperature}
    ...                                             temperature_measurements=${temperature_measurements}
